  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>At Heriot-Watt University Malaysia, you’ll experience a blend of British academic excellence and a global perspective. The university provides career-focused undergraduate and postgraduate programs in Business, Engineering, Built Environment, and Science.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At Heriot-Watt Malaysia, your student life will be vibrant and inclusive, with a diverse student body from over 50 countries. There are a number of clubs and societies that you can join.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The university provides you with a range of accommodation options for different preferences and budgets. These include university-owned and third-party accommodations, close to the campus. You can choose from single rooms to shared rooms and private spaces, all equipped with modern facilities.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>You’ll find the Tan Sri (Dr) Yeoh Tiong Lay Library, which is a two-storey facility providing you with multiple study resources. These include study rooms, electronic journals, databases, and over 70,000 e-books.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
